{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravosphere is an arcade-inspired physics based marble-roller with a gravitational twist!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>150 levels</strong> with various special mechanics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No jump button</strong>! You need to control the ball with gravity by tilting the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique <strong>gravity-boosting</strong> mechanic that increases the ceiling for fun and skill expression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KB+mouse and controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-based <strong>medals</strong> and other <strong>challenges</strong> for every level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Native <strong>speedrunning</strong> support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom level</strong> support with a Blender plugin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online <strong>leaderboards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable <strong>skins</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more planned features down the line!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f The downloadable 'Demo' version only contains a subset of the planned levels, mechanics and features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo controls:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD  / Left Stick:</strong> <i>Move</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Mouse Move / Right Stick:</strong> <i>Turn Camera</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right Click / Left Trigger:</strong> <i>Toggle Camera Lock</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left Click / Space / Bottom Face Button:</strong> <i>Gravity Boost</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse Wheel / D-Pad:</strong> <i>Change Zoom Level</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R / Left Face Button:</strong> <i>Quick Retry</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape / Start:</strong> <i>Pause Menu</i><br>      <br>  </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011700?t=1758718778","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011700?t=1758718778","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011700/256f58897d56be41e7bd3661415a457f1c8c2229/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758718778","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011700/256f58897d56be41e7bd3661415a457f1c8c2229/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758718778","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4011750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravosphere is an arcade-inspired physics based marble-roller with a gravitational twist!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>150 levels</strong> with various special mechanics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No jump button</strong>! You need to control the ball with gravity by tilting the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique <strong>gravity-boosting</strong> mechanic that increases the ceiling for fun and skill expression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KB+mouse and controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-based <strong>medals</strong> and other <strong>challenges</strong> for every level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Native <strong>speedrunning</strong> support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom level